  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core Support EDEN Center</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Core Support Eden Center</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EDEN Center is an Albanian non-governmental environmental organization. This is core support to their Strategic Plan 2023-2028. EDEN Center will focus its work in 4 strategic directions: 1) Public participation in environmental decision-making; 2) Climate Change and Energy; 3) The green economy; 4) Environmental activism and youth. The support will contribute to improving the internal capacities of EDEN including mainstreaming of perspectives.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EDEN Center &#xE4;r en albansk icke-statlig milj&#xF6;organisation. Detta &#xE4;r ett centralt st&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r deras strategiska plan 2023-2028. EDEN Center kommer att fokusera sitt arbete i 4 strategiska riktningar: 1) Allm&#xE4;nhetens deltagande i beslutsfattande p&#xE5; milj&#xF6;omr&#xE5;det; 2) Klimatf&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndringar och energi. 3) Den gr&#xF6;na ekonomin. 4) Milj&#xF6;aktivism och ungdomar. St&#xF6;det kommer att bidra till att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra den interna kapaciteten i EDEN, bland annat genom att integrera olika perspektiv.</narrative>
  </description>
